<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Dadas says 96 net down 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Dadas says 96 net down 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's financial consultancy Dadas said on Thursday 1996 net profit fell to 221 million tolars ($1.44 million) from 240 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company said it was satisfied with its results and forecast this year's net profit to remain unchanged.</p>
<p>Dadas said turnover surged to 8.3 billion tolars from 3.7 billion a year ago, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>Dadas shares finished Thursday's session up 2.5 percent at 8,200 tolars on volume of 87 shares. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
